WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Hopus Home. Drop a file or choose one.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.000
The tools wheel. The orange slice is the highlighted tool.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Crop an image. Pick a ratio, drag the area, and save a new copy.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.000
The trim range. Drag the orange bar to set the start and end.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.500
The window arrangement wheel.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Home in the dark theme.
